enviroplus-exporter (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First Debian package of the lean fork.
  * Remove InfluxDB and Luftdaten support (and the influxdb-client, requests,
    RPi.GPIO and smbus dependencies). The -i/-l flags still accept "false".
  * Log to stderr/journald only; no enviroplus_exporter.log in the working directory.
  * Catch I2C errors when reading the temperature; do not crash when the PMS5003 is absent.
  * Replace the `i2cdetect -y 1` "reset" with a pause; add a minimum loop period.
  * Bundle the Pimoroni libraries (vendor/) in /usr/lib/enviroplus.
  * Add the optional enviroplus-lcd package (clock display).

 -- ikonia <ikonia@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 14 Oct 2026 18:50:00 +0000
